What this license covers

The code, the page design, the genre data (the lineage, the dates and
places, the descriptions and listening notes, the choice of artists and
records), the Chinese text and the synthesized sketches are covered by the
license above.

It does not cover material that belongs to others:

- Artist, band, record, label and genre names, which belong to their owners.
  They are listed here as facts about music history, with no recordings,
  cover art or lyrics reproduced.
- The genre histories were researched against Wikipedia's genre articles,
  Musicmap (https://musicmap.info/, Kwinten Crauwels) and Ishkur's Guide to
  Electronic Music (https://music.ishkur.com/). Their texts, maps and data are
  not reproduced here and remain theirs.
- Alexander Okunev's Rock Music Tree (rocktree.tumblr.com, 2012), the chart
  that prompted this site and suggested the rock section's genres. The chart
  itself is not reproduced.

This is an independent reference site, not affiliated with any artist, label
or publication.
